   "parameters": {
    "width": 720,
    "height": 200,
    "content": "## I.LPRB \u2014 Report B \"Jobs By Status\" (open pipeline \u2192 Good Business split) (thin transport ONLY)\n\nGmail \u2192 POST raw PDF bytes \u2192 LP-MCP. ZERO parsing here \u2014 all parse/validate/write logic lives in LP-MCP `src/jobs/lp-report-ingest.js` (fail-closed). LP schedules this email ~6:15 ET daily.\n\n**TO-VERIFY on first real email:** the Gmail `q` filter (sender + exact subject) is a best guess \u2014 pin both from the first live message, then activate. Non-matching emails simply stay in the inbox.\n\nA 200 with success:false = deterministic rejection (bad PDF) \u2014 do NOT retry; it's logged in scorecard_ingest_log + GroupMe. 5xx = transport error \u2014 node retries 3x."
